hile  you're dealing with that  somebody has to do it somebody has to  lead and somebody  has to help get the the healing and  the rebuilding process started  and i am the chief and  i am in the position to impact that  um so i just have to be strong and and i  have to  do it for everyone else hopefully we can  all find our way  we would like to do something for you  chief rainbow i was so invested in your  story and we spoke to our friends at  pastine  the oldest italian specialty foods in  north america  and they were just incredible and they  responded  and we wanted to give you this ten  thousand dollar check  on behalf of them and all of us at the  show  and i know it's not enough but  just a little start to say that you are  an inspiration to us all  and i'm going to be replaying that in my  mind over and over that  when you're in some of the hardest  situations  how you flip that switch and care for  others  i have learned a lot from you and i just  thank you for your dedication and  inspiration and talking with us today  so here's so much a little something not  enough but i thank our friends at  pastine  and thank you chief rainbow for being  the example to us  all we'll be right back thank you so  much thank you  thank you thank you  [Music]  you
 

